            "state": "translated",
            "value": "スキル名の先頭または末尾にハイフンは使用できません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A skill name may not contain two hyphens in a row.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "技能名称不能包含连续两个连字符。"
